>> Slurp := Ihe ohuru.

Slurp mgbe-ọbịara: ['ohuru'] mee: {
	nke-ya str := [''].
}.


Slurp mgbe-ọbịara: ['zaghachi:'] mee: { :blah
		(nke-ya str = ['']) eziokwu: {
			nke-ya str tinye-na-njedebe: blah.
		}, ma-ọ-bụghị-ya: {
			nke-ya str tinye-na-njedebe: [' '].
			nke-ya str tinye-na-njedebe: blah.
		}.
}.

Slurp mgbe-ọbịara: ['zaghachi:na:'] mee: { :blah :blahah
		nke-ya str tinye-na-njedebe: (blah site-na: 0 ogologo: (blah ogologo - 1)).
		nke-ya str tinye-na-njedebe: [' '].
		nke-ya str tinye-na-njedebe: blahah.
}.

Slurp mgbe-ọbịara: ['obtain'] mee: {
	>> buffer := nke-ya str.
	nke-ya str := ['']. <- buffer.
}.


Slurp ohuru hello world.
Mpụta dee: (Slurp obtain), ahịrị-ọhụrụ. 
Mpụta dee: (Slurp obtain), ahịrị-ọhụrụ. 
Slurp hello world.
>> x := Slurp ohuru.
Mpụta dee: (x obtain), ahịrị-ọhụrụ. 
x hi there.
Mpụta dee: (x obtain), ahịrị-ọhụrụ. 
